VCS X-2025.06-SP2 (/tools_vendor/synopsys/vcs/X-2025.06-SP2/bin/vcs) probe of $value$plusargs("x=%d", int unsigned u), u preloaded 0xDEADBEEF, the same simv_probe as gen_cm162_vcs_probe.log; 2026-09-04T04:37:21Z
FORM $'+x=1\n'        PROBE set=1 u=0 hex=00000000
FORM $'+x=1\r'        PROBE set=1 u=0 hex=00000000
